   "szLabel": "desc",
   "szText": "{if:SF_21}{c_label}Fury Cost: {/c}{c_resource}{Resource Cost}{/c}\r\n{/if}{c_label}Generate Fury:{/c_label} {c_resource}{Script Formula 0}{/c_resource}\r\n{if:ADVANCED_TOOLTIP}{c_label}Lucky Hit Chance: {/c}{c_resource}[{Combat Effect Chance}|%|]{/c}\r\n{/if}Bash the enemy with your weapon, dealing {c_number}{payload:MELEE_PAYLOAD}{/c} damage. \r\n\r\nEvery {if:Mod.Upgrade2}{c_number}[{SF_2}]rd{/c}{else}[{c_number}[{SF_2}]th{/c}{/if} {c_important}Bash{/c} will clobber, Stunning enemies for {c_number}{buffduration:STUN}{/c} seconds. ",
